{'symbol': 'DUK', 'date': '2022-02-02 11:06:00', 'title': "DUKE ENERGY NAMED ONE OF FORTUNE'S 'WORLD'S MOST ADMIRED COMPANIES' FOR FIFTH CONSECUTIVE YEAR", 'text': "CHARLOTTE, N.C., FEB. 2, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0IN RECOGNITION OF THE GREAT PROGRESS THE COMPANY HAS MADE AGAINST ITS STRATEGIC AND FINANCIAL GOALS, DUKE ENERGY (NYSE: DUK) WAS ONCE AGAIN NAMED TO FORTUNE MAGAZINE'S 2022 LIST OF THE WORLD'S MOST ADMIRED COMPANIES FOR THE FIFTH YEAR IN A ROW."}